WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:24.983
I’ve been married
for almost 50 years.

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:29.988
So, my wife knows what
it’s like to be a writer,

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:33.825
and she also knows what
it’s like to be a writer’s wife.

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:37.412
I really wanted to say
something about how

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:40.832
a long-term marriage creates
its own Boo’ya Moon.

00:00:40.832 --> 00:00:44.711
People outside that
marriage don’t see in to it.

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:50.800
Any couple who’s been together
for a long period of time,

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.428
has an understanding of each
other that’s deeply private.

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:59.809
I don’t think narratives
usually focus on

00:00:59.809 --> 00:01:02.187
the person that is
next to that author

00:01:02.187 --> 00:01:05.065
and how that person
has a very huge impact.

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:08.943
This show tries and
aims to be there

00:01:08.943 --> 00:01:12.113
and understand and
connect with that world.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:18.411
Stephen King marries both
epic and intimate really beautifully.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:31.508
Wow.

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:39.599
I never talk about my childhood.

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:41.101
How bad was it?

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:47.440
Pretty damn bad.

